01:10:51,795 --> 01:10:59,355
Anyway, she's already pregnant, and what you're saying here is not a valid reason

861
01:10:59,635 --> 01:11:01,949
to have an abortion if that's what you're referring to,

862
01:11:02,042 --> 01:11:04,241
because that's the only thing I can understand from this.

863
01:11:05,035 --> 01:11:08,278
Your mother doesn't want the child, your wife doesn't want the child.

