And there needs to be a valid reason for having it,

868
01:11:27,094 --> 01:11:35,910
the health of the mother or some scholars would say, situations like forced rape or things like that.

869
01:11:36,505 --> 01:11:42,537
 It is allowed before 42 days because after 42 days, it is a living human being.

