According to the Hadith(حديث) of Rasool Allah ﷺ , the soul enters the body at the age of 42 days,

872
01:11:56,323 --> 01:12:00,964
so it will be considered killing a human being after that stage.

873
01:12:02,531 --> 01:12:09,461
However, before 42 days, even though it is not considered to be alive yet.

