01:12:10,008 --> 01:12:14,586
This not a valid reason to have that, you should have Taqwa(تقوى) of Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ

875
01:12:14,611 --> 01:12:16,657
and you should have Tawakkal(توكل) on Allahعَزَّوَجَلْ.

876
01:12:16,915 --> 01:12:21,696
It was something that was destined and ordained and it happened.

877
01:12:21,985 --> 01:12:26,123
And you say Al-Hamdolillah(ألحمدلله), and your wife should just be patient and wait,

878
01:12:26,581 --> 01:12:28,623
and she is here.

879
01:12:28,934 --> 01:12:34,980
Believe me, sister as soon as you have that child, you will love that child

880
01:12:35,878 --> 01:12:38,334
because you will be the mother of that child

881
01:12:38,889 --> 01:12:42,921
and Allah will put in your heart, the love of your child

882
01:12:43,469 --> 01:12:47,352
and you would regret even thinking about this.

